# Shell scripts must stay LF: the SBT "on-the-fly" Holon deployment
# (examples/nexmark-remote) bind-mounts them into Linux containers without a
# CRLF-stripping COPY step, so a CRLF working-tree checkout (core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows) would break them. This also protects the experiment runner scripts.
*.sh text eol=lf
